WEBVTT

00:00:00.802 --> 00:00:01.551
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:03.707 --> 00:00:04.822
<v><b>A:</b></v> Good afternoon.

00:00:05.017 --> 00:00:06.064
How can I help you?

00:00:06.325 --> 00:00:08.855
<v><b>B:</b></v> I have a reservation for five nights.

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:09.807
<v><b>A:</b></v> What’s your name?

00:00:10.231 --> 00:00:11.351
<v><b>B:</b></v> Wayne Roberts.

00:00:11.834 --> 00:00:13.681
<v><b>A:</b></v> How do you spell your first name?

00:00:14.305 --> 00:00:17.950
<v><b>B:</b></v> W-A-Y-N-E.

00:00:18.366 --> 00:00:19.411
<v><b>A:</b></v> Just a moment.

00:00:22.835 --> 00:00:23.518
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:25.939 --> 00:00:30.536
<v><b>A:</b></v> So, the sofa is eight hundred and ninety-nine pounds and ninety-nine in total.

00:00:30.937 --> 00:00:32.659
What’s the address for delivery?

00:00:33.088 --> 00:00:34.618
Is it a London address?

00:00:34.768 --> 00:00:36.598
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, it’s in south London.

00:00:36.753 --> 00:00:37.894
<v><b>A:</b></v> What’s the postcode?

00:00:38.169 --> 00:00:41.845
<v><b>B:</b></v> It’s S-E twenty-one eight G-P.

00:00:42.463 --> 00:00:44.362
<v><b>A:</b></v> And the address is…?

00:00:44.575 --> 00:00:47.306
<v><b>B:</b></v> Fourteen Dangerford Road, flat two.

00:00:47.615 --> 00:00:49.551
That’s in Forest Hill, London.

00:00:53.062 --> 00:00:53.761
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:54.892 --> 00:00:58.063
<v><b>A:</b></v> Welcome to our mobile phone helpline.

00:00:58.682 --> 00:01:03.228
Please say the number of the mobile phone you have a problem with.

00:01:03.617 --> 00:01:11.375
<v><b>B:</b></v> Oh seven seven oh-oh, nine oh-oh, seven eight two.

00:01:13.341 --> 00:01:14.122
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:01:16.623 --> 00:01:21.134
<v><b>A:</b></v> Now, every Friday I’m going to give you some writing to do

00:01:21.135 --> 00:01:23.316
for homework at the weekend.

00:01:23.784 --> 00:01:30.277
You can either give it to me in class on the Monday, or you can send it to me by email.

00:01:30.813 --> 00:01:36.040
I’m going to give you my email address and I’d like you to write it down. OK?

00:01:36.672 --> 00:01:45.337
It’s J-V-I-N-E-sixty-four dot Z-Y-X at O-U-P dot com.

00:01:46.023 --> 00:01:48.101
<v><b>B:</b></v> Can you repeat that, please?

00:01:48.559 --> 00:02:02.800
<v><b>A:</b></v> Yes, J-V-I-N-E-sixty-four dot Z-Y-X at O-U-P dot com.

00:02:03.309 --> 00:02:06.332
Now, I’m going to write it on the board for you.

00:02:10.801 --> 00:02:11.821
Did you get it right?

00:02:12.600 --> 00:02:13.359
Well done.

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:21.436
Remember, this symbol is called at in English, and this one is dot.

00:02:24.438 --> 00:02:25.377
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:02:27.555 --> 00:02:28.323
<v><b>A:</b></v> Good evening.

00:02:28.436 --> 00:02:31.895
<v><b>B:</b></v> Hi. We have a table booked for seven thirty.

00:02:31.962 --> 00:02:33.898
<v><b>A:</b></v> Yes, madam. What name please?

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:35.600
<v><b>B:</b></v> Ann Rathbone.

00:02:35.950 --> 00:02:40.288
R-A-T-H-B-O-N-E.

00:02:40.469 --> 00:02:41.787
<v><b>A:</b></v> Ah, yes, here we are.

00:02:41.984 --> 00:02:43.680
Can you come this way please?

00:02:46.507 --> 00:02:47.381
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:02:49.744 --> 00:02:52.275
<v><b>A:</b></v> OK, Susannah, that’s great.

00:02:52.828 --> 00:02:54.259
Here’s your student card.

00:02:54.736 --> 00:02:58.299
Your classes start on Monday at nine a.m.

00:02:58.811 --> 00:03:04.082
Now, the classes are not here in the main school, but in a different building.

00:03:04.284 --> 00:03:04.972
<v><b>B:</b></v> Oh?

00:03:05.159 --> 00:03:10.048
<v><b>A:</b></v> But it’s very near, just five minutes’ walk from here, in Russell Street.

00:03:10.392 --> 00:03:12.473
<v><b>B:</b></v> Sorry, what’s the address?

00:03:12.745 --> 00:03:15.087
<v><b>A:</b></v> It’s sixteen Russell Street.

00:03:15.429 --> 00:03:20.398
That’s R-U-double S-E-double L.

00:03:21.102 --> 00:03:23.148
Let me show you on your phone.

00:03:23.372 --> 00:03:24.435
<v><b>B:</b></v> Thank you.